<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<definitions xmlns="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20191111/MODEL/"
             xmlns:dmndi="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20191111/DMNDI/"
             xmlns:dc="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20181101/DC/"
             xmlns:di="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20181101/DI/"
             id="Definitions_PA-42.1-lease-negotiation-administration"
             name="PA 42.1 lease negotiation administration"
             namespace="https://erpplans.local/dmn/PA-42.1-lease-negotiation-administration"
             exporter="erpplans generate-dmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <decision id="Decision_W1854_01" name="Authorization threshold — W1854">
    <description>Source: VS-42-property-lease-admin/PA-42.1-lease-negotiation-administration.md · workflow W1854 · step row (authorization thresholds)
Note: 4 non-monetary tier(s) in the source list are excluded from this amount-based table.
The source states only escalating lower bounds (&gt; PHP A -&gt; role 1; &gt; PHP B -&gt; role 2, ...); interpreted as an approval ladder — each band runs from its threshold to the next tier&#x27;s threshold.
Verbatim: CFO reviews financial terms: (a) total lease obligation: monthly rent × 12 months × lease term + escalation, (b) NPV of lease payments for PFRS 16 lease liability calculation, (c) impact on BuildRight Property Management, Inc. cash flow and intercompany settlement with BuildRight Depot, Inc., (d) comparison to benchmark rents in same area, (e) approval: lease commitments &gt; PHP 50M require CEO approval; &gt; PHP 200M require Board approval | CFO | CEO / Board | 1 week</description>
    <decisionTable hitPolicy="U">
      <input id="Decision_W1854_01_In01" label="Amount (PHP)">
        <inputExpression id="Decision_W1854_01_InExpr01" typeRef="number">
          <text>Amount</text>
        </inputExpression>
      </input>
      <output id="Decision_W1854_01_Out01" label="Approver" name="Approver" typeRef="string"/>
      <rule id="Decision_W1854_01_Rule01">
        <inputEntry><text>(50000000..200000000]</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;CEO&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="Decision_W1854_01_Rule02">
        <inputEntry><text>&gt; 200000000</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry><text>&quot;Board + CFO + CEO&quot;</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
    </decisionTable>
  </decision>
  <dmndi:DMNDI>
    <dmndi:DMNDiagram id="Diagram_1">
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="Decision_W1854_01_di" dmnElementRef="Decision_W1854_01">
        <dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="200" height="90"/>
      </dmndi:DMNShape>
    </dmndi:DMNDiagram>
  </dmndi:DMNDI>
</definitions>
